From: Alessandro Astone <alessandro.astone@canonical.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Sep 2025 16:09:56 +0200
Subject: xi2: Expose a logical touch device

Create a new GdkDevice used for reporting all touch events from the XI2
Virtual Core Pointer. It tracks the same XI2 pointer device, but reports
to have source GDK_SOURCE_TOUCHSCREEN.

Add a GdkX11SeatXI2 class extending GdkSeatDefault to manage it.

Forwarded: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gtk/-/merge_requests/8951
Bug: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gtk/-/issues/7515
Bug: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gtk/-/issues/7508
Bug: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gtk/-/issues/5610
Bug: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gtk/-/issues/3542
Bug-Ubuntu: https://launchpad.net/bugs/2119066
Bug-Ubuntu: https://launchpad.net/bugs/2119065
Bug-Ubuntu: https://launchpad.net/bugs/2051886
---
